#X obj 60 7682 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty ENV\ TIMES 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 7710 e_t1 (Time 1) 0..99: time 1 \; e_t2 (Time 2) 0..99: time 2 \; e_t3 (Time 3) 0..99: time 3 \; e_t4 (Time 4) 0..99: time 4 \; e_t5 (T5 release) 0..99: release time 1 (to L5) \; e_t6 (T6 release) 0..99: release time 2 (to zero), f 64;
